<title>UK: CSFB sets 200 billion lire seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>CSFB sets 200 billion lire seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT SUISSE FINANCIAL PRODUCTS</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   COUPON   **7.3	 MATURITY	.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.575   PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **ISSUER HAS OPTION AFTER TWO YEARS TO CONVERT ISSUE</p>
<p>		TO AN FRN PAYING 6M LIBOR +25 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
